Package: zigcmake
Version: 0.1
Title: A CMake Consumer of zig-libs
Description: Written for r-zig's stress suite (stress/README.md). Its
    configure.win runs CMake on tools/probe, which finds libs-zig-pixi's
    abseil, GEOS, oneTBB and expat CMake configs, links a program against
    them and runs it.
License: GPL-3
Author: r-zig
Maintainer: r-zig <r-zig@example.invalid>
OS_type: windows
